<https://w3id.org/laderr#failedToDamage> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "failedToDamage"@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/laderr#inhibits
<https://w3id.org/laderr#inhibits> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/laderr#inhibits> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/laderr#Control> .
<https://w3id.org/laderr#inhibits> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://w3id.org/laderr#Threat> .
<https://w3id.org/laderr#inhibits> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An Entity inhibits another if it has a Capability that disables a Vulnerability, while the inhibited Entity has a Capability that exploits the same Vulnerability."@en .
<https://w3id.org/laderr#inhibits> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/laderr> .
<https://w3id.org/laderr#inhibits> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "inhibits"@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/laderr#preserves
<https://w3id.org/laderr#preserves> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/laderr#preserves> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/laderr#Resilience> .
<https://w3id.org/laderr#preserves> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://w3id.org/laderr#Capability> .
<https://w3id.org/laderr#preserves> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A Resilience preserves a Capability by ensuring it remains functional (i.e., it preserves the value of this capability)."@en .
<https://w3id.org/laderr#preserves> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/laderr> .
<https://w3id.org/laderr#preserves> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "preserves"@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/laderr#preservesAgainst
<https://w3id.org/laderr#preservesAgainst> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/laderr#preservesAgainst> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#topObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/laderr#preservesAgainst> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/laderr#Resilience> .
<https://w3id.org/laderr#preservesAgainst> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://w3id.org/laderr#Capability> .
<https://w3id.org/laderr#preservesAgainst> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Indicates that a Resilience  preserves an entity despite the presence of a Capability in a Threat that would otherwise exploit a vulnerability."@en .
<https://w3id.org/laderr#preservesAgainst> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/laderr> .
<https://w3id.org/laderr#preservesAgainst> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "preservesAgainst"@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/laderr#preservesDespite
<https://w3id.org/laderr#preservesDespite> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/laderr#preservesDespite> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/laderr#Resilience> .
<https://w3id.org/laderr#preservesDespite> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://w3id.org/laderr#Vulnerability> .
<https://w3id.org/laderr#preservesDespite> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Indicates that a Resilience capability ensures the preservation of an Asset despite an existing Vulnerability on it."@en .
<https://w3id.org/laderr#preservesDespite> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/laderr> .
<https://w3id.org/laderr#preservesDespite> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "preservesDespite"@en .
