<https://w3id.org/laderr#incident> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A scenario type in which a disruptive event has occurred, and its impact is being assessed."@en .
<https://w3id.org/laderr#incident> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/laderr> .
<https://w3id.org/laderr#incident> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "incident"@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/laderr#not_resilient
