<https://w3id.org/laderr#not_resilient> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A scenario type where the system lacks resilience, meaning threats successfully exploit vulnerabilities, leading to damage or loss."@en .
<https://w3id.org/laderr#not_resilient> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/laderr> .
<https://w3id.org/laderr#not_resilient> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "not_resilient"@en .
